@page "/prerender-checks"
@inject Bit.Butil.WebAuthn WebAuthn

@* What particular members answer during a static render. The sweep only asks whether a call completed; a member
   that answers a security question has to fail closed as well, and that is a question about its value. Its own
   page rather than a probe on the sweep's, so a check that breaks fails its own test and not the sweep. App.razor
   renders this page outside Routes, so it is static in every mode; Bit.Butil.Tests.Hosting reads the results out
   of the HTML. *@

<h1>Butil prerender checks</h1>

@* With no runtime there is no user to verify, so the answer has to be no rather than whatever the defaults add up to. *@
<p id="check-webauthn-verify">@_webAuthnVerified</p>

@code {
    public const string Route = "/prerender-checks";

    private bool? _webAuthnVerified;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() => _webAuthnVerified = await WebAuthn.Verify();
}
